license: MIT
abstract: >-
  SENSE maps PSILCA social risk and opportunity indicators onto Brightway
  process inventories, including ecoinvent and custom databases, for calculation
  alongside environmental life-cycle impacts. Social scores support risk and
  opportunity assessment. The software licence does not replace input-data licences.
